## 0. Files and what each one is for

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `Promoter_Classifier_PRACTICAL.ipynb` | 47 cells, 4 small gaps marked `# ---- YOUR TURN ----` |
| `promoter_dataset.csv` (0.83 MB) | 3,000 human windows |
| `mouse_holdout.csv` (0.25 MB) | 900 mouse windows |
| `challenge_sequences.csv` | 12 unlabelled sequences |
| `challenge_answers.csv`  | the key (Part 6 reads it) |


